At the bottom of this space, there seemed to be some sort of elaborate workshop full of many intricate, moving, hexagonal machines sitting on top a colorful, geometrically patterned floor. (Mainly squares) The colors were all bright, and happy...Yellows, greens, oranges, turquoise...with a very other-wordly and ethereal glow to it. It very much seemed like Willy Wonka meets space aliens. I was on what seemed like a factory floor, and I could see radiant beams of golden energy coursing up and out of each of the intricately detailed machines. Small hexagonal entities were busy blinking in and out of existence in front of each machine, making sure each one was working as it should.

